Subject: [PATCH 10/29] =?UTF-8?q?arm64/m7642:=20=E5=86=85=E5=BB=BA=20DTB?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E7=A7=BB=E5=87=BA=20.init=EF=BC=9Bfree=5Finitmem=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=B8=8D=E5=86=8D=E6=AF=92=E5=8C=96=20init=20=E6=AE=B5?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
