Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

两者都是 free_initmem 卡点的修复：
- m7642-dtb.S 从 .init.rodata 改为 .rodata，否则 DTB 会被 POISON_FREE_INITMEM
  的 0xcc memset 写坏（DTB 必须活到启动之后）。
- free_initmem() 用 -1 代替 POISON_FREE_INITMEM：页照常归还，不做毒化。
  毒化本身在该平台上会导致启动挂死，机制待查（见 Documentation/mstar/m7642/
  confirmed-facts.md §34.36）。

真机验证：修复后内核到达 run_init_process / kernel_execve / begin_new_exec /
ret_to_user（EL0），dmesg 打印 "Run /init as init process"。
---
 arch/arm64/kernel/m7642-dtb.S | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/mm/init.c          | 9 ++++++++-
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/kernel/m7642-dtb.S b/arch/arm64/kernel/m7642-dtb.S
index 6fc195ce7..3a8beec57 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/kernel/m7642-dtb.S
+++ b/arch/arm64/kernel/m7642-dtb.S
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@
 
 #include <linux/linkage.h>
 
-	.section .init.rodata, "a"
+	.section .rodata, "a"
 	.balign 8
 	.global __m7642_dtb
 __m7642_dtb:
diff --git a/arch/arm64/mm/init.c b/arch/arm64/mm/init.c
index fbf215ecc..d4a42b761 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/mm/init.c
+++ b/arch/arm64/mm/init.c
@@ -394,8 +394,15 @@ void free_initmem(void)
 	WARN_ON(!IS_ALIGNED((unsigned long)lm_init_begin, PAGE_SIZE));
 	WARN_ON(!IS_ALIGNED((unsigned long)lm_init_end, PAGE_SIZE));
 
+	/*
+	 * m7642 bring-up: poisoning the freed __init region hangs this platform
+	 * shortly afterwards (the pages are freed correctly, but the 0xcc memset
+	 * takes the machine down).  Free the pages without poisoning them; the
+	 * root cause of the hang is still being tracked down.
+	 * See Documentation/mstar/m7642/confirmed-facts.md.
+	 */
 	free_reserved_area(lm_init_begin, lm_init_end,
-			   POISON_FREE_INITMEM, "unused kernel");
+			   -1, "unused kernel");
 	/*
 	 * Unmap the __init region but leave the VM area in place. This
 	 * prevents the region from being reused for kernel modules, which
